  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Through a day-long ceremony in a place of shadow, you bond with your armor and learn how to avoid attacks that would normally hit. You learn to shift movements and posture in subtle ways.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Armor training class ability, Bonded Item (Armor), Feng Shui or Knowledge (Religion) 1 rank</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When the character wears his bonded suit of armor, he retains his armor bonus against touch attacks.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> Touch attacks ignore armor bonuses.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc51\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
